            "review_title": "Review at Baozi",
            "review_text": "1926yanks\nSeattle, Washington753 contributions\n0\nGreat Meal of Duck & Soft-shell Crab\nAug 2025 • Friends\nWe came a little after 1 pm & avoided the lunch rush. The soft-she’ll crab was amazing: served in a Chinese bun with a great sauce. And the crab was huge. We also had a crab steamed in ginger-& they cracked it for us. So it was easy to eat. \nThe roast duck slices were also amazing. With some veggies, they could be wrapped in mini-sandwiches. \nMy only suggestion is that they add a few Sai Gon microbrews. The beer offerings here were the same ones all places offer (boring). Maybe even a couple Taiwan specialty beers, not just the light-tasting ones.\nRead more\nWritten August 12, 2025",
