            "review_title": "Review at Baozi",
            "review_text": "Moon\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam31 contributions\n0\nGood food with reasonable price\nJan 2020\nThis definitely is one of my common spot for dinner with friends in town and I went there at least twice a month. The restaurant served Asia food and specialized for its baos (Must try the wasabi Chicken baoz). My most recommend dishes are the seaweed salad, poach egg, baos and Xi Chuan beef rice. \nI tried both this and another one in Nguyen Thai Hoc st but somehow the menu here is having more selections. \nThe service here is very quick. If you go for 2 people, I suggest booking the table near the windows as the restaurant is quite crowded and all the tables are set up really near to each other which made you feel less privacy.\nRead more\nWritten January 20, 2020",
